    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "NEW YORK CITY\nDONG KINGMAN\nNEW YORK CITY\nDong Kingman, the award winning Chinese-American artist, travels the world sketching and painting\nthe beautiful, the monumental and the picturesque. His watercolors grace more than forty\npermanent museum and private collections in the USA and abroad\nOne of the most remarkable real estate deals in history was negotiated in 1624 when Peter Minuit\nbought the island of Manhattan from the Indians for a reported $24 worth of trinkets\nToday, a city of almost 8 million people, New York is perhaps the greatest port in the world and the\nfinancial, intellectual and artistic center of the United States of America. It is a city of superlatives,\nin a class by itself. Pan Am serves New York every day on its Round-the-World flights, and one\ncan reach New York on Pan Am from virtually anywhere in the world\nJAM.\nY",
      "First Class Menus\nLibationso\nSherry\nDubonnet\nCampari\nManhattan\nGin Martini Vodka Martini\nVermouth\nBloody Mary\nScrewdriver\nWhiskey Sour\nTom Collins Vodka Collins Daiquiri\nScotch Bourbon\nCanadian Gin Vodka Rum\nPremium Beer\nCoffee\nDelectationdo\nDélice Florida\nRipe honeydew melon accentuates the delicate flavor of premium crabmeat.\nFilet Mignon Marchand de Vin\nSelect grilled tenderloin steak with a rich red wine sauce\nServed with fresh potato rounds baked together golden brown\nand spinach soufflé in broiled tomato.\nChicken Suprême Smitane\nTender breast of chicken with a spritely sauce of white wine,\nflavorful broth and a hint of sour cream.\nServed with buttery egg noodles, mushrooms and green bean and tomato saute.\nParfait Tropique\nCoconut and orange ice creams in a tropical taste medley.\nServed with rich butter cookies.\nTea\nDecaffeinated Coffee\nSelected Red and White Wines\nChampagne Brut\nDrambuie\nBénédictine\nCreme de Menthe\nCognac Napoléon Cointreau Kahlúa\nAmaretto di Saronno\nD.4338\n2001.080.023"
    ],
